          "english_quote": "Two virgins stood between each pair of the four, along the gate’s four sides.",
          "issue": "Independently checked against the selected Greek, this arrangement is compatible with αὐτῶν. However, the simplified edition’s notes omit the supplied apparatus alternative αὐτῆς reported for A and do not disclose that the working pronoun is supported by versions. The alternative affects reference within the arrangement description.",
          "suggested_revision": "Retain the working translation and add an accessible textual note distinguishing selected αὐτῶν (‘between them’) from A’s reported αὐτῆς (‘of/between it’). Attribute the information to the supplied printed-apparatus transcription rather than claiming direct manuscript verification. Review the proposed note before adoption.",
